  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466470",
      "title": "Creating a Component Programmatically",
      "lectureOrder": 639,
      "videoOrder": 589,
      "sourceHash": "36a30f9f0ee1294b30e810cf8f8719f014b5475ea16e83d12d07d397312a3ceb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "Teacher: With the placeholder directive added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 6.18,
          "en": "Let's go back to the off component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.18,
          "end": 8.58,
          "en": "and now we need to add a new element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.58,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "Now you could add a diff, but there is a better element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 14.49,
          "en": "You should use NG template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.49,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "This is a directive angular ships with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "which will not actually render anything to the dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "but still is accessible in the angular templating language.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "This is great because we don't add the overhead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "of an extra do element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "Instead we can now simply just well get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 34.65,
          "en": "to a place in the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.65,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "To NG template we add app placeholder like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 41.69,
          "en": "This new placeholder directive we created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.69,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "By the way, you don't have to create it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "You can also create it outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 49.114,
          "en": "of that row here if you wish to anywhere here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.114,
          "end": 52.86,
          "en": "So now we have that NG template element added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "which is considered by angular when it parses the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "but which does not render a real element to the real dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "which is great, but we will be able to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 65.79,
          "en": "to this place in the dom thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.79,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "It's simply remembered internally by angular you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.53,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "So now we have that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 72.66,
          "en": "How does it help us?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.66,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "Well, in the off component types group file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "we can now get access to that directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "with the help of that view child, which you already learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "about in the component deep dive section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 84.996,
          "en": "View child is imported from at angular core",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.996,
          "end": 89.114,
          "en": "and to at view child you pass a selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.114,
          "end": 92.22,
          "en": "Now you could pass in the name of a local reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.22,
          "end": 94.68,
          "en": "as a string, but that's not the goal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.68,
          "end": 97.77000000000001,
          "en": "Instead you can all pass in a type and it will look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.77000000000001,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "for the existence of that type in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "So if you pass in the placeholder directive as a type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.78999999999999,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "it will automatically find the first place where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 110.25,
          "en": "we use that directive in the template of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.25,
          "end": 112.602,
          "en": "So here I'll add placeholder directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.602,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "and this needs to be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "from your placeholder directive file of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "And I'll add it as a type like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 120.78,
          "en": "And as I mentioned at view child will then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.78,
          "end": 123.813,
          "en": "find the first occurrence of that directive in the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.68,
          "end": 128.77,
          "en": "Then we can store this in a property of that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "like alert host would be a fitting name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "because it will be the place where we host our alert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "and this will be of type placeholder directive of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 143.043,
          "en": "So we get access to that directive we use in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.043,
          "end": 146.19,
          "en": "and we store that in alert host.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.19,
          "end": 149.61,
          "en": "Now that alert host can be used in show error alert.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 151.68,
          "en": "We have our factory down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.68,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "Now we can get access to the view container reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "of our host.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 158.41,
          "en": "So here we can get access to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.627,
          "end": 161.37,
          "en": "with host view container ref for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "And this simply is the view container ref we find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "in our alert host, which is the directive we selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.523,
          "en": "we selected with at view child view container ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.523,
          "end": 175.11,
          "en": "because our host has the view container ref property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.11,
          "end": 177.27,
          "en": "because it is just the directive we're selecting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 178.29,
          "en": "in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.29,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "And our placeholder directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 182.61,
          "en": "of course exposes view container ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.61,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "as a public property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.38,
          "en": "So therefore since we expose it there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 190.02,
          "en": "we can get access to it here in the off component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.02,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "And I'm storing it in a new constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 193.68,
          "en": "You of course don't need to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.68,
          "end": 195.6,
          "en": "You could continue working with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 195.6,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "So now I store a reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 198.99,
          "en": "at view container ref property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 198.99,
          "end": 201.363,
          "en": "in the host view container ref constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 205.56,
          "en": "Now the next thing is that we clear anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.56,
          "end": 207.6,
          "en": "that might have been rendered there before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.6,
          "end": 211.71,
          "en": "by simply calling clear on this view container reference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 211.71,
          "end": 214.62,
          "en": "As I mentioned, the view container reference is not just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.62,
          "end": 216.42000000000002,
          "en": "like a pair of coordinates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.42000000000002,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "Instead it is our object that allows you to interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "with that place in the dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "and clear simply clears all angular components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 225.87,
          "en": "that have been rendered in that place before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 225.87,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "And I want to clear everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 227.16,
          "end": 228.992,
          "en": "before I render something new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 228.992,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "Now we're almost there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 233.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now we can use our component factory to create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 233.67000000000002,
          "end": 237.41899999999998,
          "en": "a new alert component in that host you container reference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 237.41899999999998,
          "end": 238.92000000000002,
          "en": "And this is done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 238.92000000000002,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "by simply now using our host new container reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 244.92,
          "en": "and calling create component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.92,
          "end": 246.9,
          "en": "As I mentioned, you have methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 246.9,
          "end": 249.39,
          "en": "for creating things in that place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 249.39,
          "end": 251.43,
          "en": "So here I create a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 251.43,
          "end": 254.76,
          "en": "and this now does not need the type of the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 254.76,
          "end": 256.8,
          "en": "but it needs such a factory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 256.8,
          "end": 257.79,
          "en": "So here I pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.79,
          "end": 261.54,
          "en": "in that alert component factory we created earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 261.54,
          "end": 264.753,
          "en": "and this will now create a new component in that place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 267.18,
          "end": 268.413,
          "en": "Let's give this a trial.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 269.51800000000003,
          "end": 270.73,
          "en": "Save all the files and let, let's wait for this to reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 270.73,
          "end": 274.57,
          "en": "And now let's try logging in with fake credentials.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 274.57,
          "end": 276.48,
          "en": "And I get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 276.48,
          "end": 279.03,
          "en": "I get an error that no comp component factory found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 279.03,
          "end": 280.44,
          "en": "for alert component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 280.44,
          "end": 283.35,
          "en": "Did you add it to engine module entry components?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 283.35,
          "end": 284.2,
          "en": "Now what is that?",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
